</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4419280</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25922525</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Yang HJ, Ehm G, Kim YE, Yun JY, Lee WW, Kim A, Kim HJ, Jeon B (2017) Liquid levodopa&#x2010;carbidopa in advanced Parkinson's disease with motor complications. J Neurol Sci 377: 6&#x2013;11</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">28477709</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhang P, Tian B (2014) Metabolic syndrome: an important risk factor for Parkinson's disease. Oxid Med Cell Longev 2014: 729194</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4052080</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">24955210</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>
